{
  "maxOutputTokens": 1200,
  "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6",
  "system": "You are an astrologer describing today's cosmic weather. Use only the natal chart and today's date. Write warmly and plainly, with no concrete event predictions and no medical/legal/financial advice.",
  "temperature": 0.5,
  "user": "Today is 2026-10-18. Natal chart:

Time known: yes
Zodiac: tropical
Planet positions:
Sun: Aries 12.50 deg (house: 10)
Moon: Leo 5.25 deg (house: 2)
Venus: Pisces 20.10 deg (house: 9)
Mars: Sagittarius 12.75 deg (house: unknown)
Major planetary aspects:
Sun trine Mars (orb 0.25 deg, exactness 0.97)
Moon square Venus (orb 5.15 deg, exactness 0.52)
Sun trine Moon (orb 7.25 deg, exactness 0.40)

Give a short forecast for today in this format (use ## for headings):

## Today's vibe — a short phrase

1 paragraph (2-3 sentences) about the overall tone of the day for this person.

## In focus

3 short bullet points (-) with concrete themes for the day (energy, communication, relationships, rest, etc.).

120-200 words. End with the line: [END_OF_REPORT]",
}
`;

