exports[`prompt defaults (golden copy) > premiumPdf.en.aspects 1`] = `
{
  "maxOutputTokens": 8000,
  "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6",
  "system": "You are the author of a premium astrology booklet and a strict English editor. Write a cohesive, elegant reading for an adult reader: deep, specific, and interpretive rather than encyclopedic. Use only the provided natal chart data. Do not invent events, diagnoses, transits, or medical, legal, or financial advice.",
  "temperature": 0.5,
  "user": "Write only one premium PDF section for Anna.

Write the section about every major aspect in the list. For each aspect name the planets, type and orb, then explain the inner dynamic: conflict, support, amplification or opportunity. Explain sextiles, squares, trines, oppositions and conjunctions fully, with no empty labels.

The text must be cohesive, with logical transitions, sections and subsections. Do not write phrases like “this is a story”, “story interpretation”, or “in this story”.

Do not use dry phrases such as “The Sun shows identity...” or “the placement describes temperament...”. Explain specifically from the chart data: what the placement means, through which life sphere it expresses itself, and how it may appear in behavior.

Length: 800-1200 words.

Markdown headings ## and ### are allowed. No tables.

Chart data:

Person data:
Name: Anna
Birth date: 1990-04-02
Birth time: 14:30
Birth place: Moscow, Russia
Timezone: Europe/Moscow
Chart mode: natal
House system: koch
Zodiac: tropical
Angles:
ASC: 10.00° Cancer
MC: 0.00° Aries
Planet positions:
Sun: 12.50° Aries, house 10 (career, status, vocation, public role)
Moon: 5.25° Leo, house 2 (resources, money, self-worth)
Venus: 20.10° Pisces, house 9 (beliefs, travel, higher study, meaning)
Mars: 12.75° Sagittarius, house unknown
Houses:
1: 10.00° Cancer; identity, body, manner of acting; no planets in this house
2: 5.00° Leo; resources, money, self-worth; Moon
3: 0.00° Virgo; learning, siblings, communication; no planets in this house
4: 0.00° Libra; home, family roots, inner foundation; no planets in this house
5: 5.00° Scorpio; creativity, romance, children, play; no planets in this house
6: 10.00° Sagittarius; work rhythm, health, craft, service; no planets in this house
7: 10.00° Capricorn; partnership, marriage, open mirrors; no planets in this house
8: 5.00° Aquarius; shared resources, intimacy, crisis, trust; no planets in this house
9: 0.00° Pisces; beliefs, travel, higher study, meaning; Venus
10: 0.00° Aries; career, status, vocation, public role; Sun
11: 5.00° Taurus; friends, networks, hopes, community; no planets in this house
12: 10.00° Gemini; subconscious, solitude, endings, spirit; no planets in this house
Major aspects:
Sun trine Mars; orb 0.25°; exactness 97%
Moon square Venus; orb 5.15°; exactness 52%
Sun trine Moon; orb 7.25°; exactness 40%

Existing interface text may be used only as additional context. Do not copy generic wording:

1. Sun in Aries (planets). Detail: 10th house
Direct, brave and quick to start.

2. Moon in Leo.
Needs warmth and recognition.

End with a separate line: [END_OF_REPORT]",
}
`;

